# Directory Structure — React / Vite

```
src/
├── main.tsx                    ← Bootstrap app
├── App.tsx                     ← Root component, router config
├── pages/                      ← Page-level components (1-to-1 with routes)
│   └── HomePage.tsx
├── components/
│   ├── atoms/                  ← Smallest units (Button, Input, Badge)
│   ├── molecules/              ← Composed from atoms (FormField, SearchBar)
│   └── organisms/              ← Complex components (Header, DataTable)
├── hooks/                      ← Custom hooks (useAuth, useFetch)
├── store/                      ← Global state (Zustand / Redux Toolkit)
├── types/
│   └── index.ts
└── utils/
    └── index.ts
```

## Principles

- **Custom hooks** for reusable logic — naming: `use<Domain>`
- **`pages/`** are shells only — call hooks and compose organisms
- Component files use PascalCase: `UserCard.tsx`
